&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Settlements and Other:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 7.19pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 27.75pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; text-decoration: underline; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; text-decoration: underline;"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; text-decoration: underline;"&gt;749,066)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;December 31, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 21.56pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 22.25pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;321,005&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: italic;"&gt;Change In Unrealized Gains/Losses Included &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: italic;"&gt;In&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: italic;"&gt; Earnings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 19.79pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: italic;"&gt;(For Derivative Instruments Held &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: italic;"&gt;At&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: italic;"&gt; December 31, 2025):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: italic;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;Other Expenses, Net:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 14.22pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;668,236)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="10" type="A"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 13.25pt; padding-left: 4.75pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Commitments and Contingencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;APGI is party to unconditional purchase obligations for electricity (hydro dams, transmission and substations) that &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;expire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; in 2028. Commitments related to these contracts total $10,878,651 in 2026, $4,412,655 in 2027, and $4,672,147 in 2028. Expenditures under these contracts totaled $7,507,057 in 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;With permanent closure of the Wenatchee Smelter in December of 2021, excess power sale proceeds offset costs for the year. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;APGI is party to purchase obligations for coal that &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;expire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; in 2030. Commitments related to these contracts total $65,637,500 in 2026, $65,241,000 in 2027, $67,482,000 in 2028, $68,940,000 in 2029, and $69,354,000 in 2030. Expenditures under these contracts totaled $65,434,384 in 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="11" type="A"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 16.31pt; padding-left: 1.69pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Supplier Finance Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Alcoa has various supplier finance programs with third-party financial institutions that are made available to suppliers to facilitate payment term negotiations. Under the terms of these agreements, participating suppliers receive payment in advance of the payment date from third-party financial institutions for qualifying invoices. Alcoa&amp;#8217;s obligations to its suppliers, including amounts due and payment terms, are not impacted by its suppliers&amp;#8217; participation in these programs. Alcoa does not pledge any assets as security or provide any guarantees beyond payment of outstanding invoices at maturity under these arrangements. Alcoa does not pay fees to the financial institutions under these arrangements. The Company is a party to these agreements and as of December 31, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; and December 31, 2024, qualifying supplier invoices outstanding under these programs were $4,193,931 and $2,625,330 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;respectively, and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; have payment terms ranging from 30 to 120 days. These obligations are included in accounts payable on the Company&amp;#8217;s Balance Sheet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The rollforward of Alcoa&amp;#8217;s outstanding FERC obligations confirmed as valid under its supplier finance program for the year ended December 31, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; are as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;December 31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 10.31pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; text-decoration: underline;"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Confirmed FERC Obligations outstanding at beginning of year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 10.89pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;2,625,330&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Invoices confirmed during the year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 25.45pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;17,352,981&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Confirmed invoices paid during the year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 1.91pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;(15,784,380)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 15.17pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Foreign currency translation and other&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 11.39pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Confirmed FERC Obligations outstanding at end of year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 3.01pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;4,193,931&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="12" type="A"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 15.09pt; padding-left: 2.91pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Subsequent Events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI';"&gt;In March 2026, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI';"&gt;subsequent to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI';"&gt;year&amp;#8209;end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI';"&gt;, Alcoa settled an insurance claim for $56,000,000 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;related to a 2024 coal silo failure at the Warrick power plant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI';"&gt;. After considering the applicable deductible of $10,000,000 and advance payments received in 2025 of $8,600,000, a gain of $37,400,000 was recorded in the income statement during the first quarter of 2026. The 2025 gain was recorded to operating expenses ($4,000,000) and Miscellaneous non-operating income (expenses), net of $4,600,000, which can be found in the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI';"&gt;Other&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI';"&gt; category within the investing section of the cash flow statement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI';"&gt;During the first quarter of 2026, Alcoa sold land at various APGI sites for cash proceeds of $2,166,182 and recorded a net gain in the income statement of $2,148,852.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
